'''Gudetama Plate''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]] and can be unlocked in the [[Gudetama Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 348
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Gudetama Plate
|name2 = Gudetama Bacon Plate
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Gudetama Bacon Plate''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Gudetama Plate sadly does not serve up a satisfying main course as a meatshield. With a 4.20 second cooldown, it can only be used as a solo meatshield if you use it with a side of Research Combos. Even then, it's nowhere near satisfying enough as a solo meatshield to distract the enemies due to its 10,200 HP. Its $360 cost also isn't justified due to how low-quality the 'meat' part of the meatshield is. As an Anti-Floating meatshield, 40,800 HP does help it retain some dignity but it can only be used as a third meatshield. Overall, not a great pull. Fortunately, he can be used as a solo meatshield in floating stages or just to clear out weak peons because of his okay DPS.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

